data: {"seq":19,"turn_id":"task_7bf92b124e99249bb37cd359d277c2b8","type":"assistant_delta","ts":"2026-11-26T18:21:47.243407+08:00","data":{"final":false,"message_id":"task_7bf92b124e99249bb37cd359d277c2b8-reply","text":"修复后的代码未能正确处理 CSV 数据。问题在于 `next(reader, None)` 会跳过第一行（表头），但若 CSV 中只有表头，`reader` 将为空，导致返回空列表。然而，当 CSV 包含数据行时，`next(reader, None)` 会跳过表头，但 `list(reader)` 会读取剩余的数据行。\n\n为确保只有表头时返回空列表，我们需要在读取数据之前检查是否有数据行。以下是修复后的代码：\n\n```python\nimport csv\nfrom io import StringIO\n\n\ndef read_records(source: str) -> list[dict[str, str]]:\n    if not source:\n        return []\n    reader = csv.DictReader(StringIO(source))\n    # "},"internal":{"source":"worker","type":"progress","attempt_id":"96bc6769e3190b5df5e918290da6b7c2","task_seq":18,"payload":{"v":1,"ts":"2026-11-26T10:21:47.240Z","seq":13,"data":{"text":"修复后的代码未能正确处理 CSV 数据。问题在于 `next(reader, None)` 会跳过第一行（表头），但若 CSV 中只有表头，`reader` 将为空，导致返回空列表。然而，当 CSV 包含数据行时，`next(reader, None)` 会跳过表头，但 `list(reader)` 会读取剩余的数据行。\n\n为确保只有表头时返回空列表，我们需要在读取数据之前检查是否有数据行。以下是修复后的代码：\n\n```python\nimport csv\nfrom io import StringIO\n\n\ndef read_records(source: str) -> list[dict[str, str]]:\n    if not source:\n        return []\n    reader = csv.DictReader(StringIO(source))\n    # ","final":false,"message_id":"task_7bf92b124e99249bb37cd359d277c2b8-reply"},"kind":"assistant_delta","type":"progress","message":"回复","attempt_id":"96bc6769e3190b5df5e918290da6b7c2"}}}

